 const stepInfo={model:['👤','Build your character','Choose the 3D model, make it small enough, and add a skeleton.','Choose a GLB, preview it, align the colored joints, then save.'],personality:['💬','Give them a personality','Decide how they act and what they say.','Pick a starter personality, edit the words and sliders, then save.'],voice:['🎙️','Give them a voice','Match your dialogue to actual audio recordings.','Save your dialogue first. Import recordings one at a time or in a batch.'],animation:['🎬','Make them move','Create, import, preview and adjust movements.','Generate the basic movements, show your model in 3D, then play each animation.'],mission:['📍','Turn them into a mission giver','Prepare a character for a mission in the main game.','Choose an existing game character or integrate your imported model first.'],publish:['✅','Check that everything is ready','See what is finished and what still needs work.','Tick off the model and required animations, then download the complete package.'],manager:['📦','Import & release','Bring a finished character from your phone into the PC game.','Import the .vrcompanion package, test privately, then prepare a public release.'],relationships:['💞','Build relationships','Choose who this companion reacts to and what they say.','Select an NPC or the player, set their relationship, then save.'],residence:['🏠','Choose their home','Assign a specific building and apartment.','Choose always home or set home hours, then save.'],guide:['📖','Learn at your own pace','Step-by-step instructions and illustrated joint placement.','Open any lesson and follow the instructions in order.']};
 const fieldHelp={'Choose a companion':'Pick an existing character or choose New companion to start fresh.','Name':'The name shown to players in the VR room.','Male / Female':'Choose the roster where the companion should appear.','Model file — .GLB required':'A GLB file holds the 3D shape, textures and possibly a skeleton and animations.','Downsizer quality':'Automatic gives the best chance of getting below 15 MB; smaller texture sizes reduce detail.','Starting pose':'T-pose means arms straight out; A-pose means arms angled down.','Model forward direction':'Choose the direction the character faces. If a pose bends backwards, check this setting.','Personality template':'A ready-made starting point. Every line and slider can still be edited.','Personality description':'A short character description shown in their profile, not a live AI brain.','Starts conversations':'Higher means they speak or invite you to join them more readily.','Flirtatiousness':'Higher means the character chooses more playful or flirty dialogue and gestures.','Approaches player':'Higher means they come over to you more often.','Attention to player':'Higher means they generally spend more time looking at you.','Personal space (m)':'How far away they stop when they approach. Lower means closer.','Walking speed (m/s)':'How fast they move around the room.','Time between remarks (s)':'How long they wait between spontaneous comments. Shorter means more talkative.','Dialogue category':'Choose the situation that triggers these words.','What they say (one line per row)':'Write one possible spoken line on each new line. The game can pick among them.','Choose voice recording':'Import the exact MP3, WAV or Ogg recording for this line.','Choose multiple recordings':'Select several files named with their full line IDs from the downloaded list.','Filter dialogue':'Show only recordings from the selected dialogue situation.','Animation file — .GLB required':'Import a GLB containing a skeleton and animation clips; FBX/BVH need conversion first.','Clip in file':'Pick the movement inside your animation file.','Display name':'The friendly name you will see in your local motion library.','Target character model':'Choose which character to preview and test.','Pose category':'Browse poses by activity, such as sitting, dancing or yoga.','Free pose template':'A static body position, like a photograph; it is not an animation by itself.','Mirror left / right':'Swap the left and right limbs of the selected pose.','Joint':'Choose the specific bone you want to adjust.','Rotation axis':'Choose the direction of rotation. Try small steps first.','Playback speed':'Slow a movement down to inspect it; 1× is normal speed.','Playback mode':'Loop repeats the clip; play once stops after one cycle.','Animation position':'Move the slider to a moment in an animation, then jump and pause.','Keyframe time (seconds)':'The exact moment where your captured pose is stored. The editor fills the motion between poses.','Template category':'Filter available animation clips by what they do.','Template':'A motion already present on the model; not all skeletons carry the same clips.','Existing model animation':'Select an animation embedded in this character’s GLB.','Imported animation':'Select a saved motion from your local library.','Also create running animation':'Add a bonus running clip in addition to the six required movements.','Movement prompt':'Describe a movement for an external AI tool; this editor does not spend credits.','Open saved animation template':'Load a previously saved keyframe JSON for a compatible skeleton.','Select prop':'Choose a reference floor or piece of furniture to see next to the character.','Show floor grid':'Show lines on the floor to help judge position and distance.','Import your own prop (.glb)':'Load a 3D furniture or decoration model for the preview.','Move':'Choose whether the next position adjustment moves your character or your prop.','Choose saved .vrcompanion file':'A complete package from another device containing the model and saved setup.','Companion package (.vrcompanion)':'Select the package downloaded from the phone editor.'};
 const actionHelp={'SAVE COMPANION':'Keep your changes on this device.','Auto Downsize to 15 MB':'Compress the model; the original file is kept.','Add humanoid skeleton':'Create the bones that allow a static character to move.','Align skeleton / Move dots only':'Place the bone centers without bending the character.','Apply skeleton alignment':'Rebuild the rig with your new joint positions.','Cancel dot adjustment':'Leave joint placement without applying the changes.','Preview original model':'See the unprocessed model.','Preview processed / current model':'Inspect the model you are editing now.','Pose character / Move limbs':'Drag the dots to bend the limbs.','Apply pose template':'Move the character into your selected pose.','Reset pose':'Return to the starting pose.','Auto-Generate Basic Animations':'Make the six required movements with no Meshy credits.','Regenerate starter animations':'Replace previously generated basic movements.','Apply template / fill empty categories':'Fill empty dialogue categories and set the behavior sliders.','Replace all with template':'Replace the existing description, sliders and dialogue.','Copy prompt for ChatGPT':'Copy instructions for making custom dialogue.','Apply pasted personality':'Load the JSON supplied by ChatGPT.','Play recording':'Listen to the selected imported voice line.','Download numbered dialogue list':'Get a list for naming multiple voice recordings.','Import matched recordings':'Attach files to matching dialogue line IDs.','Show character in 3D':'Load the selected model in the preview window.','Save animation to local library':'Keep the imported motion for future use.','Preview imported animation':'Test a motion on the chosen model.','Add motion to selected VR companion':'Assign a compatible imported motion to this companion.','Capture keyframe':'Save the current pose at the chosen time.','Play custom animation':'Watch the movement between your captured poses.','Clear keyframes':'Remove the captured poses from this editing session.','Play template':'Watch the selected existing motion.','Play existing clip':'Play a clip embedded in the model.','Apply playback speed':'Change how fast the animation plays.','Jump to position and pause':'Freeze a moment so you can edit its pose.','Resume original animation':'Resume playback and discard unsaved pose edits.','Export custom animation GLB':'Create a GLB containing the new keyframe animation.','Save animation mappings':'Give existing clips the required game animation names.','Create mission giver draft':'Open a separate draft in the NPC editor.','View release checklist':'See which required parts are finished.','Import package and add to VR area':'Load a complete character for private developer testing.','Prepare public release package':'Export the tested character for public integration.','Download saved companion package':'Save one file with model, profile, motions and recordings.','Download companion transfer':'Move the entire saved character to another device.','Download processed GLB':'Keep a copy of the processed model.','Download model GLB for game integration':'Export only the 3D model, skeleton and embedded clips.','Download personality and setup':'Export the character’s configuration as JSON.','Front view':'Look straight at the character.','Flip pose facing':'Reverse the direction used by the pose templates.','Reset camera':'Return the camera to its original view.','Snap to floor':'Move the character’s feet or lowest point onto the floor.','Reset position':'Restore the initial preview position.','Show selected prop':'Display the chosen reference furniture.','Load prop':'Open your own GLB prop in the preview.','Apply position':'Move or rotate the selected preview object.','Follow scrolling':'Keep the preview visible while you scroll.','Collapse preview':'Hide the preview temporarily to save screen space.'};
